# Normalize text files to LF on checkout.
#
# Shell scripts are the critical case: a CRLF shebang (`#!/bin/sh\r`) makes the
# kernel look for an interpreter named "/bin/sh\r", so container entrypoints
# die with:
#   exec /usr/local/bin/telesrv-container-entrypoint failed: No such file or directory
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
